SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT license covers the original source code in this repository only:
the scraper scripts (`scripts/`), the site application code (`site/app.js`,
`site/index.html`, `site/style.css`), and build tooling.

It does NOT cover:
- the game dataset (`site/data.js`) — see LICENSE-DATA.md
- the item/station/spell/skill icons (`site/icons/`) — Jagex Limited's
  copyrighted game assets, used under Jagex's Fan Content Policy
- the embedded fonts (`site/fonts/`) — SIL Open Font License (see LICENSE-DATA.md)

See LICENSE-DATA.md and the README "Licensing" section for the full picture.
